<title>USA: TENNIS-CHICAGO WOMEN'S RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-CHICAGO WOMEN'S RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the $450,000</p>
<p>Ameritech Cup women's tennis tournament on Tuesday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Amy Frazier (U.S.) beat Meilen Tu (U.S.) 6-3 7-5</p>
<p>Linda Wild (U.S.) beat Kimberly Po (U.S.) 6-2 6-3</p>
<p>Irina Spirlea (Romania) beat Marianne Werdel Witmeyer (U.S.)</p>
<p>6-3 6-0</p>
<p>7-Brenda Schultz-McCarthy (Netherlands) beat Lori McNeil</p>
<p>(U.S.) 7-6 (7-2) 6-7 (3-7) 6-4</p>
<p>Mary Joe Fernandez (U.S.) beat Meghan Shaugnessy (U.S.) 6-2</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>Jennifer Capriati (U.S.) beat Lisa Raymond (U.S.) 7-5 7-6</p>
<p>(7-1)</p>
</text>
